                    <p>Each control is built around a simple idea you can picture: only you can sign in as you, only approved apps can run, nobody holds the keys all the time, and your backups sit where a thief can’t reach them.</p>
                    <p>Real protection is rarely a single toggle. Every control is actually a chain of safeguards working in sequence, mapped line-by-line to proven standards like the ASD Essentials, SMB1001, and MITRE ATT&CK. We connect those pieces so you don't have to.</p>
                    <p>The result is protection you can understand at a glance. Straightforward concepts that pass or fail, leaving zero guesswork about where you stand.</p>
                </div>
